.SH "نام (NAME)"
find-libprovides \- Find soname\*(Aqs which are provided by a package
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
find\-libprovides [options]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
Finds soname\(cqs provided by a package and prints out a list in the following
format \fI<soname>=<soversion>\-<soarch>\fP.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
\fB\-\-ignore\-internal\fP
.RS 4
Ignore internal libraries.
.RE
.SH "HOMEPAGE"
.sp
\fI\c
.URL "https://gitlab.archlinux.org/archlinux/devtools" "" "\fP"
.sp
